# Task 162-031-fix Execution Plan

## Goal
READ-ONLY audit of MCP introspection tools (status, history, retro, explain,
help, doctor, analyze_project, agent_list, skill_list, watch, audit). Produce
a single audit report at docs/audits/sprint-162-live/T-162-LIVE-031-mcp-introspection.md.

## Constraints (ABSOLUTE)
- READ-ONLY: no src/ modifications, no deletes, no refactors
- scope.filesWrite = single audit report path
- 10 audit dimensions per task

## Steps
1. Inventory src/mcp/tools/*.ts and locate the 11 introspection tool files
2. For each tool, verify:
   - read-only flag (annotation)
   - parameter schema parity with CLI (ADR-022-V2)
   - error propagation pattern
   - output format consistency
3. Apply 10 dimensions per file: dead code, ADR violations, conflicts, drift,
   type safety, dep hygiene, doc pollution, memory coherence, config integrity,
   migration triage
4. Write report with sections: Scope, Findings (P0-P3), Evidence,
   Migration triage, Recommendation
5. Write .result with selfAssessment + tokenUsage

## Tools to audit (per DIRECTIVES Task 31)
- status, history, retro, explain, help, doctor, analyze_project,
  agent_list, skill_list, watch, audit

## Risk Surface
- Read-only flag missing → tool may be misclassified by clients
- CLI/MCP parameter drift → ADR-022-V2 violation
- Output format inconsistency → user confusion
